{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-driven-architecture","title":"性能驱动架构决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/architecture-evolution/performance-driven-architecture","wordCount":930,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能驱动架构决策\">性能驱动架构决策</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>架构决策不应由技术热度驱动，而应由可量化的性能目标倒推。Core Web Vitals（LCP、INP、CLS）已成为 Google 搜索排名因素和用户体验的量化标尺。本文将这些指标转化为架构选型的决策依据：从性能预算的建立，到基于真实用户数据的架构取舍，再到持续的性能守护机制。核心观点是——每一个架构决策都有对应的性能代价和收益，这些代价必须被量化而非凭直觉判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"core-web-vitals-与架构映射\">Core Web Vitals 与架构映射</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Performance Metrics&quot;&#10;        LCP[&quot;LCP: Largest Contentful Paint&quot;]&#10;        INP[&quot;INP: Interaction to Next Paint&quot;]&#10;        CLS[&quot;CLS: Cumulative Layout Shift&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Architecture Decisions&quot;&#10;        R1[&quot;Rendering Strategy&quot;]&#10;        R2[&quot;JS Bundle Strategy&quot;]&#10;        R3[&quot;Layout Architecture&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    LCP --&gt; R1&#10;    INP --&gt; R2&#10;    CLS --&gt; R3\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"Performance Metrics\"\n        LCP[\"LCP: Largest Contentful Paint\"]\n        INP[\"INP: Interaction to Next Paint\"]\n        CLS[\"CLS: Cumulative Layout Shift\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Architecture Decisions\"\n        R1[\"Rendering Strategy\"]\n        R2[\"JS Bundle Strategy\"]\n        R3[\"Layout Architecture\"]\n    end\n    LCP --&gt; R1\n    INP --&gt; R2\n    CLS --&gt; R3</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>目标值</th>\n<th>影响的架构决策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LCP ≤ 2.5s</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n<td>渲染策略 (SSR/SSG vs CSR)、图片加载策略、字体加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INP ≤ 200ms</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n<td>JS bundle 大小、水合策略、事件处理架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLS ≤ 0.1</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n<td>布局系统、动态内容加载、字体/图片预留空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"性能预算体系\">性能预算体系</h3><p>性能预算是架构的约束条件，与功能需求同等重要：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// performance-budget.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;metrics&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;lcp&quot;: { &quot;budget&quot;: 2500, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;ms&quot;, &quot;page&quot;: &quot;homepage&quot; },&#10;    &quot;inp&quot;: { &quot;budget&quot;: 200, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;ms&quot;, &quot;page&quot;: &quot;all&quot; },&#10;    &quot;cls&quot;: { &quot;budget&quot;: 0.1, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;score&quot;, &quot;page&quot;: &quot;all&quot; },&#10;    &quot;tbt&quot;: { &quot;budget&quot;: 300, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;ms&quot;, &quot;page&quot;: &quot;all&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;resources&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;total-js&quot;: { &quot;budget&quot;: 200, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;kb&quot;, &quot;compression&quot;: &quot;gzip&quot; },&#10;    &quot;total-css&quot;: { &quot;budget&quot;: 50, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;kb&quot;, &quot;compression&quot;: &quot;gzip&quot; },&#10;    &quot;main-bundle&quot;: { &quot;budget&quot;: 80, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;kb&quot;, &quot;compression&quot;: &quot;gzip&quot; },&#10;    &quot;third-party-js&quot;: { &quot;budget&quot;: 60, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;kb&quot;, &quot;compression&quot;: &quot;gzip&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;timing&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;ttfb&quot;: { &quot;budget&quot;: 600, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;ms&quot; },&#10;    &quot;fcp&quot;: { &quot;budget&quot;: 1800, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;ms&quot; },&#10;    &quot;tti&quot;: { &quot;budget&quot;: 3800, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;ms&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// performance-budget.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"metrics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"lcp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"page\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"homepage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"inp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"page\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"all\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"cls\"</span><span style=\