shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    repoBranchBase: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'main'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"性能预算分配策略\">性能预算分配策略</h3><p>将总预算按功能重要性分配：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>预算 (JS gzip)</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>框架运行时</td>\n<td>45KB</td>\n<td>React/Vue 核心</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由和状态</td>\n<td>15KB</td>\n<td>Router + Store</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首屏关键组件</td>\n<td>30KB</td>\n<td>Header + Hero + CTA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方分析</td>\n<td>20KB</td>\n<td>Analytics + Monitoring</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>余量（新功能）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>40KB</strong></td>\n<td>给未来功能预留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>总计</strong></td>\n<td><strong>150KB</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"性能与功能的权衡决策\">性能与功能的权衡决策</h3><p>当新功能会突破性能预算时的决策流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>量化影响</strong>：该功能增加多少 KB？影响哪些 CWV 指标？</li>\n<li><strong>探索替代</strong>：有无更轻量的实现方式？能否 lazy load？</li>\n<li><strong>交换空间</strong>：能否通过优化其他模块腾出预算？</li>\n<li><strong>业务论证</strong>：功能的商业价值是否值得性能代价？</li>\n<li><strong>条件加载</strong>：能否仅在特定用户群/设备上加载？</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"真实用户监控-rum-驱动决策\">真实用户监控 (RUM) 驱动决策</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 基于 RUM 数据的架构决策反馈循环&#10;// lib/performance-reporter.ts&#10;import { onLCP, onINP, onCLS } from &#39;web-vitals&#39;;&#10;&#10;function reportToAnalytics(metric: Metric) {&#10;  // 按页面、设备、网络分段上报&#10;  const payload = {&#10;    name: metric.name,&#10;    value: metric.value,&#10;    page: window.location.pathname,&#10;    device: getDeviceType(),&#10;    connection: (navigator as any).connection?.effectiveType,&#10;    renderStrategy: document.querySelector(&#39;meta[name=&quot;render-strategy&quot;]&#39;)?.content,&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  navigator.sendBeacon(&#39;/api/vitals&#39;, JSON.stringify(payload));&#10;}&#10;&#10;onLCP(reportToAnalytics);&#10;onINP(reportToAnalytics);&#10;onCLS(reportToAnalytics);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 基于 RUM 数据的架构决策反馈循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// lib/performance-reporter.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { onLCP, onINP, onCLS } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'web-vitals'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reportToAnalytics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 按页面、设备、网络分段上报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: metric.name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    value: metric.value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    page: window.location.pathname,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    device: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getDeviceType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    connection: (navigator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).connection?.effectiveType,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    renderStrategy: document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'meta[name=\"render-strategy\"]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)?.content,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  navigator.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sendBeacon</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/vitals'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onLCP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reportToAnalytics);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onINP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reportToAnalytics);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onCLS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reportToAnalytics);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>通过 RUM 数据回答关键架构问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SSR 页面的 P75 LCP 是否真的比 CSR 好？</li>\n<li>Islands 架构在低端设备上的 INP 提升了多少？</li>\n<li>某个第三方脚本对 CLS 的实际影响是多少？</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>集成方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Lighthouse CI</td>\n<td>PR 级性能检查</td>\n<td>GitHub Actions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bundlewatch</td>\n<td>Bundle 大小监控</td>\n<td>CI check</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SpeedCurve</td>\n<td>长期性能趋势</td>\n<td>RUM + Synthetic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Calibre</td>\n<td>性能预算管理</td>\n<td>自动告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>web-vitals (npm)</td>\n<td>CWV 采集</td>\n<td>代码内嵌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>next/bundle-analyzer</td>\n<td>Next.js bundle 可视化</td>\n<td>开发时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Source Map Explorer</td>\n<td>包组成分析</td>\n<td>按需运行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>性能驱动架构决策的核心是建立&quot;性能预算 → 测量 → 决策 → 验证&quot;的闭环。每个架构选择都应有对应的性能预期和验证手段。LCP 目标决定渲染策略，INP 目标决定 JS 加载量，CLS 目标决定布局方案。将性能约束写入 CI 流水线（Lighthouse CI + Bundlewatch），让性能回归像 TypeScript 类型错误一样在合并前被拦截。最终目标不是追求极致性能，而是让性能决策从&quot;凭经验猜测&quot;变成&quot;用数据说话&quot;——当团队对性能影响有清晰的量化认知时，架构权衡就变得理性而高效。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能驱动架构决策","id":"性能驱动架构决策"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"Core Web Vitals 与架构映射","id":"core-web-vitals-与架构映射"},{"level":3,"text":"性能预算体系","id":"性能预算体系"},{"level":3,"text":"架构决策的性能代价量化","id":"架构决策的性能代价量化"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"基于 LCP 的渲染策略选择","id":"基于-lcp-的渲染策略选择"},{"level":3,"text":"CI 中的性能守护","id":"ci-中的性能守护"},{"level":3,"text":"Bundle Size 回归检测","id":"bundle-size-回归检测"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"性能预算分配策略","id":"性能预算分配策略"},{"level":3,"text":"性能与功能的权衡决策","id":"性能与功能的权衡决策"},{"level":3,"text":"真实用户监控 (RUM) 驱动决策","id":"真实用户监控-rum-驱动决策"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"渐进式迁移模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/architecture-evolution/progressive-migration-patterns"},"next":{"title":"技术选型决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/architecture-evolution/technology-selection-framework"}}